    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "model",
      "title": "Word Order in Main Clauses",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "In a main clause, the finite verb still goes in the second position. In the past perfect, that finite verb is "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "hadde",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": ". The past participle usually comes later."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hun hadde allerede gått da jeg ringte."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "She had already left when I called."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Allerede klokka åtte hadde hun gått."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Already at eight o'clock, she had left."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "statement": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "If another phrase starts the sentence, put "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "hadde",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " right after that phrase, before the subject."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "contrast",
      "title": "Past Perfect, Simple Past, and Present Perfect",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Simple past, the normal past tense for finished events, tells what happened at a past time. Present perfect, "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "har",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " plus past participle, connects a past event to now. Past perfect, "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "hadde",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " plus past participle, connects an earlier past event to a later past point."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "col_langs": [
            "en",
            "no",
            "en"
          ],
          "headers": [
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Focus"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Norwegian"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Use"
              }
            ]
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Finished past event"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Jeg bodde i Oslo i 2020."
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Simple past with a finished time"
                }
              ]
            ],
            [
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Experience up to now"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Jeg har bodd i Oslo."
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Present perfect with current relevance"
                }
              ]
            ],
            [
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Before another past point"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Jeg hadde bodd i Oslo før jeg flyttet til Tromsø."
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "Past perfect for the earlier past"
                }
              ]
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Jeg kom for sent fordi bussen hadde gått."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "I arrived late because the bus had left."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hun hadde aldri sett snø før hun kom til Norge."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "She had never seen snow before she came to Norway."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
